{
  "consent.account": "<b>Your account is at risk.</b> The game's anti-cheat can report a modified game to Kinetic Games, which may ban the account. Mods only run in private lobbies and single player, and switch off in public lobbies. Play only with friends who also agreed to this.",  // PM_TEXT_AI
